  <title xml:lang="EN">Energy and Environment Partnership Programme with the Mekong Region</title>
  <description xml:lang="EN">Energy and environment partnership with Mekong region (Cambodia, Lao PDR, Thailand, Vietnam) to improve access and promote more efficient use of renewable energy of rural houselholds, livelihoods and SME&apos;s and to contribute to abatement of greenhouse gases. Projects will be developed with the support of studies, policy development and capacity building that have potential for sustainable financing. Pilots and demonstrations are promoted.</description>
